Subject: [PATCH] [3.14] gh-60299: Fix ProxyDigestAuthHandler credential lookup
 to use proxy authority (GH-160528) (#160915)

gh-60299: Fix ProxyDigestAuthHandler credential lookup to use proxy authority (GH-160528)

AbstractDigestAuthHandler.get_authorization() always looked up
credentials using the target request URL (req.full_url), even when
invoked via ProxyDigestAuthHandler, whose credentials are registered
against the proxy's host:port.

The lookup never matched, no Proxy-Authorization header was produced,
and proxy digest auth failed with an unhandled 407.
(cherry picked from commit 9b3e095a5f2d832d3d1534751299ad38bf59ad88)

Co-authored-by: Senthil Kumaran <senthil@python.org>
Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
